<LanguageData>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_HideButtonText>隐藏</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_HideButtonText>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_HideAllButtonText>隐藏全部</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_HideAllButtonText>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_RestoreText>恢复</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_RestoreText>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_SearchLabel>筛选</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_SearchLabel>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_RestoreAllButtonText>恢复所有隐藏项</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_RestoreAllButtonText>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_BuildingsTabText>建筑</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_BuildingsTabText>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_AbilitiesTabText>能力</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_AbilitiesTabText>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_SettingsCategory>隐藏图标</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_SettingsCategory>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_GeneralTabText>通用</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_GeneralTabText>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_ShowHiddenButtonsLabel>显示隐藏按钮</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_ShowHiddenButtonsLabel>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_ShowHiddenButtonsTooltip>启用后将禁用按钮隐藏功能。</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_ShowHiddenButtonsTooltip>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_EnableAbilityHidingLabel>启用能力隐藏</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_EnableAbilityHidingLabel>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_EnableAbilityHidingTooltip>禁用后，能力隐藏功能将被完全关闭：已隐藏的能力会重新显示，且能力右键菜单中的隐藏/恢复选项会被移除。</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_EnableAbilityHidingTooltip>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_ModShift>Shift</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_ModShift>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_ModCtrl>Ctrl</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_ModCtrl>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_ModAlt>Alt</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_ModAlt>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_RevealComboLabel>显示隐藏项（按住）</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_RevealComboLabel>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_RevealComboTooltip>按住这些按键时，将临时显示隐藏的建筑和能力。默认为 Ctrl + Alt。不勾选任何按键即可禁用“按住显示”功能。</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_RevealComboTooltip>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_MenuComboLabel>启用隐藏菜单（按住）</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_MenuComboLabel>
	<Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_MenuComboTooltip>勾选任意按键后，隐藏/恢复的右键菜单仅在按住这些按键时出现；此时普通右键点击将传递给游戏或其他模组（可修复诸如机械族升级炮塔自动使用开关之类的冲突）。不勾选任何按键则右键点击时始终显示该菜单。</Taggerung_IAintBuildingThat_MenuComboTooltip>
</LanguageData>
